遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":70.99,"default_fair_val":70.99,"premium_pct":-25.2,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":12.5,"pe_forward":11,"pb_trailing":2.5,"pb_forward":2.2,"div_yield":1.89,"ps_ratio":3.4,"fcf_to_ev":8.15,"fcf_to_mcap":7.26,"liab_to_assets":47.8,"cash_to_assets":15.4,"current_ratio":0.79,"roe":20.3,"roa":10.6,"moat":{"ticker":"RYAAY","period":"2027Q1","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"瑞安航空以其低廉的票價和清晰的品牌定位，在歐洲廉價航空市場建立了強大的品牌認知度。雖然其品牌價值不如傳統全服務航空公司，但在追求性價比的消費者心中，瑞安航空已成為首選。這種品牌忠誠度轉化為一定的定價能力，使其能夠在不犧牲銷量的情況下，維持相對穩定的利潤率。然而，航空業的價格競爭激烈，使其難以獲得極高的定價權。","comment_en":"Ryanair has established strong brand recognition in the European low-cost carrier market through its consistently low fares and clear value proposition. While not commanding the premium pricing of legacy carriers, its brand is synonymous with affordability, fostering loyalty among price-sensitive travelers. This brand strength translates into a degree of pricing power, allowing it to maintain stable margins without significantly impacting volume. However, the intensely competitive nature of the airline industry limits its ability to achieve exceptional pricing power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"航空業受到嚴格的政府監管，包括飛行安全標準、航權分配和機場時刻。瑞安航空憑藉其在歐洲單一航空市場的運營經驗和對監管環境的深入理解，有效利用了這些規則。其高效的運營模式和對成本的嚴格控制，使其在符合監管要求的同時，保持了顯著的成本優勢。雖然沒有傳統意義上的專利，但其對監管的駕馭能力構成了重要的進入壁壘。","comment_en":"The airline industry is heavily regulated, encompassing safety standards, route rights, and airport slots. Ryanair leverages its extensive experience operating within Europe's single aviation market and its deep understanding of the regulatory landscape. Its highly efficient operational model and stringent cost controls allow it to comply with regulations while maintaining a significant cost advantage. While not possessing traditional patents, its adept navigation of regulatory frameworks constitutes a substantial barrier to entry."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"對於大多數乘客而言，轉換航空公司的成本相對較低，主要取決於價格和便利性。然而，瑞安航空通過其龐大的航線網絡、頻繁的航班以及對特定機場的深度滲透，為經常性旅客和商務旅客創造了一定的黏性。其會員計劃和與旅遊服務的整合也在一定程度上增加了轉換成本，但整體而言，轉換壁壘仍屬中等。","comment_en":"For most passengers, the cost of switching airlines is relatively low, primarily driven by price and convenience. However, Ryanair cultivates a degree of stickiness for frequent travelers and business users through its extensive route network, frequent flights, and deep penetration into specific airports. Loyalty programs and integration with travel services also add to switching costs to some extent, but overall, the switching barrier remains moderate."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"瑞安航空的網絡效應主要體現在其龐大的航線網絡上。更多的航線吸引更多的乘客，而更多的乘客則支持更多的航線，形成正向循環。這使得其能夠提供廣泛的歐洲目的地選擇，對尋求便捷連接的旅客具有吸引力。然而，與社交網絡或市場平台不同，其網絡效應的強度相對較弱，乘客的選擇更多基於單一航線的便利性而非網絡的整體價值。","comment_en":"Ryanair's network effects are primarily manifested in its extensive route network. More routes attract more passengers, and a larger passenger base supports the addition of more routes, creating a virtuous cycle. This allows it to offer a wide array of European destinations, appealing to travelers seeking convenient connections. However, unlike social networks or marketplaces, the strength of its network effect is relatively modest, as passenger choices are often based on the convenience of a specific route rather than the overall value of the network."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"瑞安航空的規模經濟是其最顯著的護城河之一。作為歐洲最大的廉價航空公司，其龐大的機隊、高飛機利用率、標準化機型（波音737）以及在二線機場的運營，都帶來了極低的單位運營成本。這種成本優勢使其能夠提供遠低於競爭對手的票價，並在價格戰中佔據主導地位，同時維持健康的利潤率。","comment_en":"Ryanair's economies of scale represent one of its most significant moats. As Europe's largest low-cost carrier, its massive fleet, high aircraft utilization, standardized fleet (Boeing 737), and operations at secondary airports result in exceptionally low unit operating costs. This cost advantage enables it to offer fares significantly below competitors, dominate price wars, and still maintain healthy profit margins."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"瑞安航空在歐洲眾多機場擁有重要的時刻和基地。其戰略性地選擇二線或較小機場，獲得了更低的起降費用和更靈活的時刻安排，這構成了其成本優勢的一部分。雖然這些機場並非獨一無二，但其在關鍵地點建立的運營網絡和市場滲透率，使其在特定區域內具有顯著的地理優勢，難以被競爭對手複製。","comment_en":"Ryanair holds significant slots and bases at numerous airports across Europe. Its strategic choice of secondary or smaller airports provides lower landing fees and more flexible scheduling, contributing to its cost advantage. While these airports are not unique in themselves, the operational network and market penetration established in key locations offer a distinct geographical advantage within specific regions, making it difficult for competitors to replicate."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"瑞安航空以其極致的運營效率聞名。通過標準化流程、快速的飛機周轉時間、無附加服務的簡潔模式以及嚴格的成本控制，公司實現了行業內頂尖的運營效率。這種效率不僅降低了成本，還提高了產能，使其能夠在激烈的市場競爭中保持領先地位，並為股東帶來豐厚的回報。","comment_en":"Ryanair is renowned for its extreme operational efficiency. Through standardized processes, rapid aircraft turnaround times, a no-frills model, and rigorous cost control, the company achieves industry-leading operational efficiency. This efficiency not only reduces costs but also enhances capacity, enabling it to maintain a leading position in a highly competitive market and deliver strong returns to shareholders."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"瑞安航空的管理層在資本配置方面表現出色。公司歷史上通過有效的機隊管理和對低成本運營的專注，實現了持續的盈利能力。其在擴張和回購股票之間取得了良好的平衡，並在保持強勁資產負債表的同時，為股東創造了價值。對新飛機的明智採購和對成本效益的持續追求，體現了其審慎的資本配置策略。","comment_en":"Ryanair's management demonstrates excellence in capital allocation. Historically, the company has achieved consistent profitability through effective fleet management and a focus on low-cost operations. It strikes a good balance between expansion and share repurchases, creating shareholder value while maintaining a strong balance sheet. Prudent aircraft procurement and a relentless pursuit of cost-effectiveness underscore its disciplined capital allocation strategy."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"瑞安航空的客戶保留率主要依賴於其持續提供的低票價和不斷擴張的航線網絡。對於價格敏感型客戶，一旦習慣了瑞安的價格和便利性，轉換成本會有所增加。然而，航空業的客戶忠誠度普遍不高，客戶容易被其他航空公司的促銷所吸引。瑞安通過其會員計劃和優質服務的有限提升，試圖增強客戶黏性，但其核心競爭力仍是低價。","comment_en":"Ryanair's customer retention is primarily driven by its consistently low fares and expanding route network. For price-sensitive customers, once accustomed to Ryanair's pricing and convenience, switching costs increase. However, customer loyalty in the airline industry is generally low, and customers are easily swayed by competitor promotions. Ryanair attempts to enhance stickiness through its loyalty program and limited improvements in service quality, but its core competitive advantage remains low price."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"瑞安航空的商業模式具有相當的持久性，尤其是在歐洲廉價航空市場。其低成本結構、規模經濟和品牌認知度使其能夠抵禦大多數競爭對手的挑戰。然而，航空業易受宏觀經濟波動、燃油價格變動、地緣政治事件和監管變化等外部因素影響。儘管如此，其對成本的極致控制和靈活性使其在應對這些挑戰時具有較強的韌性。","comment_en":"Ryanair's business model exhibits considerable durability, particularly within the European low-cost carrier market. Its low-cost structure, economies of scale, and brand recognition enable it to withstand challenges from most competitors. However, the airline industry is susceptible to external factors such as macroeconomic fluctuations, fuel price volatility, geopolitical events, and regulatory changes. Despite these risks, its extreme cost discipline and flexibility provide significant resilience in navigating such challenges."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"瑞安航空的護城河主要建立在其無與倫比的規模經濟和運營效率之上，這使其成為歐洲航空業的成本領導者。其品牌雖非高端，但在廉價航空領域具有極高的認知度和黏性，構成了定價權的基礎。嚴格的成本控制和對二線機場的戰略佈局，也形成了難以複製的地理與成本優勢。儘管轉換成本和網絡效應相對較弱，但其強大的成本結構和管理層審慎的資本配置，使其在行業內具備了顯著的競爭優勢，堪稱典型的「收費橋」模式，通過極低的價格吸引海量客流，從而獲得穩定的利潤。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Ryanair's moat is primarily built upon its unparalleled economies of scale and operational efficiency, establishing it as the cost leader in European aviation. While its brand isn't premium, it possesses high recognition and stickiness within the low-cost segment, forming the basis of its pricing power. Strict cost control and strategic positioning in secondary airports create hard-to-replicate geographical and cost advantages. Despite relatively weaker switching costs and network effects, its robust cost structure and prudent capital allocation by management provide a significant competitive edge. It exemplifies a 'toll bridge' model, attracting massive passenger volume through extremely low prices to generate consistent profits.","evidenceHash":"dab03d838737559d09efdf89a5e8ee3a9f3fa0d3c3e74471d75cd41e44f65b06","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"safe","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"EUR","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"f3802dec1ee54f0a83dc2b02c9eb8dfe98cffd7a794015560eaa111bdabae12c"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-03-31","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"EUR","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"f3802dec1ee54f0a83dc2b02c9eb8dfe98cffd7a794015560eaa111bdabae12c"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RYAAY.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RYAAY.png","website":"https://www.ryanair.com","ceo":"Michael O'Leary","full_time_employees":"25863","description":"Ryanair Holdings plc, together with its subsidiaries, provides scheduled-passenger airline services in Ireland, Italy, Spain, the United Kingdom, and internationally. The company offers various ancillary services; engages in other activities connected with its air passenger service, including non-flight scheduled and Internet-related services, as well as in-flight sale of beverages, food, duty-free, and merchandise; and markets car hire, travel insurance, and accommodation services through its website and mobile app. It also provides passenger and aircraft handling, ticketing, and maintenance and repair services; and markets car parking, fast-track, airport transfers, attractions, and activities on its website and mobile app, as well as sells gift vouchers. Ryanair Holdings plc was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Swords, Ireland.","description_en":"Ryanair Holdings plc, together with its subsidiaries, provides scheduled-passenger airline services in Ireland, Italy, Spain, the United Kingdom, and internationally. The company offers various ancillary services; engages in other activities connected with its air passenger service, including non-flight scheduled and Internet-related services, as well as in-flight sale of beverages, food, duty-free, and merchandise; and markets car hire, travel insurance, and accommodation services through its website and mobile app. It also provides passenger and aircraft handling, ticketing, and maintenance and repair services; and markets car parking, fast-track, airport transfers, attractions, and activities on its website and mobile app, as well as sells gift vouchers. Ryanair Holdings plc was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Swords, Ireland.","description_zh":"**瑞安航空控股公司 (Ryanair Holdings plc, RYAAY) 業務營運概述**\n\n瑞安航空控股公司 (Ryanair Holdings plc) 及其子公司主要於愛爾蘭、義大利、西班牙、英國及國際市場提供定期客運航空服務。公司營運模式的核心為低成本航空 (Low-Cost Carrier, LCC)，透過高載客率、標準化機隊（主要為波音 737 系列）及精簡的營運流程，提供具競爭力的票價。\n\n除了核心的機票銷售，瑞安航空積極拓展多元的附加服務 (Ancillary Services)。這包括機上餐飲、免稅商品及其他商品銷售；透過官方網站與行動應用程式 (App) 銷售汽車租賃、旅遊保險及住宿服務。此外，公司亦提供機場地勤、票務處理、飛機維護與維修等服務。其數位平台亦販售停車位、快速通關 (Fast-Track) 服務、機場接駁、旅遊景點門票及活動等。此一整合式服務策略，旨在最大化每位乘客的平均營收 (Ancillary Revenue)。瑞安航空成立於 1996 年，總部位於愛爾蘭的 Swords。","address":"Dublin Office Airside Business Park","city":"Swords","state":"DU","zip":"K67 NY94","